WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
JP first dashes into the post-throw space.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.350
The backdash moves outside Ryu’s attempted throw.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.650
Standing medium kick scores punish counter at the backdash spacing.

4
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.150
Forward heavy kick follows light Torbalan.

5
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.750
Standing heavy punch catches the medium-Stribog juggle.

6
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.650
Medium-plus-heavy-kick OD Torbalan extends the route.

7
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.050
Heavy Triglav finishes the OD-projectile conversion.
